def record_disbursement(conn, worker_id, category, amount_php, deduction_from_wages_php, callback_url):
    conn.execute(
        "INSERT INTO disbursements (worker_id, category, amount_php, deduction_from_wages_php) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)",
        (worker_id, category, amount_php, deduction_from_wages_php)
    )
    conn.commit()
    return {"status": "recorded", "net_deduction": deduction_from_wages_php}
```

This function uses parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection from untrusted `worker_id` inputs. It records the specific deduction amount to ensure a transparent audit trail for labor compliance regarding placement and training fees.
